{"articleNo":"2287","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2287&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009-2학기 대학원 수료자 등록 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.07.27","hit":"18173","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"510\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"65\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\">2009학년도 2학기부터 대학원에서는 학교에 직접 방문할 필요 없이 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\"><a href=\"http://202.31.128.77:8080/default.html\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#3366cc\">원스톱서비스</font></a></span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\">에서&nbsp;<br>수료자등록 신청 및 고지서 출력이 되도록</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움\">『수료자등록편의시스템』을 운영하게 되었습니다.</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 대학원 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">수료(예정)자 중&nbsp; 2010년 2월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 학위를 받기위한 학위청구나 논문연구를 계속할 학생은<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;아래와 같이 수료자 등록을 신청하시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">1. 수료자등록 대상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;:</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;일반대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원 수료생 또는 수료예정자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(본교 대학원 수료생은 누구나 신청) 수료 후 논문제출&nbsp;시한 규정 폐지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2. 수료자 등록구분&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. </span><span>일 반&nbsp; 등 록 :&nbsp; 논문연구를 계속하고자 하는 자&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font color=\"#808080\">논문연구등록 :&nbsp; 논문연구학점 미 취득자(논문연구 불합격자)<br><br><!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font>\n</font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><font color=\"#808080\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 수료자등록신청 및 접수</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></font></p><font color=\"#808080\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수료자 등록신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2009. 8. 3(월) ~ 8. 5(수) [3일간]</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수료자 등록신청 : 원스톱서비스/로그인/수료자관리</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(수료자 등록신청 후 반드시 지도교수와 유무선, 이메일로 연락하여 승인을 받으셔야 됩니다!!)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 수료자 등록생 등록금 납부 금액 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">일반등록 : 등록금액의 5%, 논문연구등록: 등록금액의 10%</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 납부기간 : 2009. 8. 18(화) ~ 8. 21(금) [4일간]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 고지서 출력방법 : 원스톱서비스/로그인/수료자관리/고지서출력</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 등록금 납부장소 : 농협 전국 지점&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 등록금 납부금액 : 수료자별 해당되는 등록금액 </span></p>\n</font><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>